---

Third-party assets used at run time (not vendored in this repository):

* MuJoCo Menagerie — Universal Robots UR10e model and meshes,
  https://github.com/google-deepmind/mujoco_menagerie, Apache License 2.0.
  Fetched on demand by `robot_descriptions`. The model is used unmodified; the
  position-actuator gains are overridden at run time (see
  `weldloop/sim/mujoco_cell.py`, which documents the change and the reason).
